      {
        "id": "509450",
        "date_added": "2026-10-17 14:24:18",
        "twitter_handle": "352E31",
        "display_name": null,
        "comment": "Family: Legea (named after the protocol verb 'legea=\u003cmethod\u003e', the only author string in the memory dump; 124 hits in memory, 0 on disk). Go 1.24 DDoS bot with a control plane, obfuscated with garble -literals plus a falsified Go header (gopclntab magic / textStart / buildinfo) that makes decompilers reject the file. 13 methods confirmed live: 9 floods (udpflood udpsmart tcpflood tcphandshake synflood ackflood greflood http dns) + rce/persist/lock/kill. C2 130.12.180.32:7001 plus 7 hardcoded fallback domains. Does not self-propagate. No public family label on any engine so far. Full analysis: https://blog.efespain.com/en/chapter-32/ | how it was delivered: https://blog.efespain.com/en/chapter-31/"
      }
    ],
